Retail Performance & Profitability Analysis Dashboard Layout

Objective: A single-page, interactive dashboard to monitor profitability, identify profit-draining categories, and assess inventory efficiency using Shipping Lead Time as a proxy for inventory turnover speed.

Target Audience: Retail Category Managers, Supply Chain Analysts, Executives

I. Dashboard Structure (Power BI/Tableau)

Section

Filters/Slicers (Top/Left Panel)

Core Visualizations (Main Canvas)

