Date Range Selector

KPI Cards (Total Sales, Total Profit, Overall Profit Margin %, Avg. Shipping Lead Time)

Instant high-level performance snapshot.

Profitability

Region Filter, Season/Month Filter

1. Bar Chart: Profit Margin % by Top 10 Category/Sub-Category

Quickly identify the most and least profitable segments.

Category Deep Dive

Product Type Filter

2. Treemap/Sunburst: Sales vs. Profit % (Size=Sales, Color=Profit Margin)

Visual segmentation of high-volume, low-margin "profit drains."

Inventory & Risk

Category Filter

3. Scatter Plot: Avg. Shipping Lead Time (Days) (X-axis) vs. Profit Margin % (Y-axis)

Key analysis for fulfillment/stocking efficiency. Look for points in the upper-right (high lead time, high margin) and lower-right (high lead time, low margin - immediate risk).

Trend & Detail

N/A

